== A Trader\'s Education from Two Decades of Indian Market Cycles
#strong[Dhanraj]
#v(6pt)#line(length: 30%, stroke: 0.5pt + rgb("#888"))#v(6pt)

#quote(block: true)[#emph[This book is a work of synthesis. It compiles, organizes, and verifies the public market commentary and trading education of a practising Indian derivatives trader, presented here under a pseudonym. Nothing in this book is investment advice, and nothing is a recommendation to buy or sell any security. Every rupee figure attributed to personal experience is an illustrative recollection, not an audited result. Markets involve substantial risk of loss. Do your own research, and consult a registered financial adviser before acting on any idea in this book.]]
